<section>
    <h2 class="page-heading">Usage</h2>

    <p>
        Below each code section is the result of the code in the section.
    </p>
    <p>
        A basic key, inline with text using the defaults:
    </p>

    <CodeBox CodeBlock="@CssClassesSnippets.Kbd_Basic_Example" AriaLabel="Basic Kbd code example" />
    <p>Press <span class="@Kbd.Base">Esc</span> to close the dialog.</p>
    <p>
        A key combination using the accent colour scheme, a larger font and a small radius of 2, the default is 3:
    </p>

    <CodeBox CodeBlock="@CssClassesSnippets.Kbd_Modifier_Example" AriaLabel="Themed kbd example code example" />

    <p>
        Press <span class="@Kbd.Base @Kbd.Scheme(KbdScheme.Accent) @Kbd.FontSize(UnitFontSize.Two) @Kbd.FixedRadius(UnitRadius.Two)">Ctrl</span>
        + 
        <span class="@Kbd.Base @Kbd.Scheme(KbdScheme.Accent) @Kbd.FontSize(UnitFontSize.Two) @Kbd.FixedRadius(UnitRadius.Two)">K</span> to open the command palette.
    </p>

</section>

